@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Figure 2.4(a)  Creation understanding and clarification
hide footbox
actor "User" as P0
participant "Frontend" as P1
participant "Projects API" as P2
participant "Understanding" as P3
participant "Local model" as P4
participant "RequirementEngine" as P5
participant "Persistence" as P6
activate P1
P0 -> P1 : Submit idea
activate P2
P1 -> P2 : POST /api/projects
activate P6
P2 -> P6 : emit_event: append event + save snapshot
deactivate P6
P2 -->> P1 : Persisted project_id + version
P1 -> P2 : POST /{id}/understand
activate P3
P2 -> P3 : execute_understanding(raw_idea)
P3 -> P4 : generate(prompt)
alt [valid extraction]
P4 -->> P3 : Valid model extraction
else [invalid / unavailable]
P4 -->> P3 : Invalid result / exception
P3 -> P3 : generate_heuristic_understanding()
end
P3 -->> P2 : Structured output + evidence label
deactivate P3
activate P5
P2 -> P5 : evaluate_requirements(output)
P5 -->> P2 : Questions + readiness
deactivate P5
activate P6
P2 -> P6 : emit_event: save context and events
deactivate P6
P2 -->> P1 : Context + next clarification
loop [while clarification remains]
P0 -> P1 : Answer question
P1 -> P2 : POST /{id}/clarify
P2 -> P2 : Update requirement/version; find next PENDING
activate P6
P2 -> P6 : emit_event: save updated context
deactivate P6
P2 -->> P1 : Next question or REQUIREMENTS_VALIDATED
end
deactivate P1
deactivate P2
note over P0,P6
Clarify updates the pending-question list; it does not re-run RequirementEngine. emit_event persists before responses.
end note
@enduml
